invariant: INV-41
file: src/rsa_avx2.c
catches: rsa_avx2_model_test
reason: product_core no longer zeroes the window's top register, which no
  group but the last writes and every group after group 0 reads. Group 1
  then adds its rows to whatever the stack held there, and the product
  is wrong. bin/rsa_avx2_model_test compares every product along a public
  operation with rsa_mont64.c at every word count.

--- old
    lanes_store(window + 4 * groups, lanes_zero());
--- new
    (void)window;
